..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : SERPROD.ARCHIVE
.. Autor          : saac
.. Verantwortlich : teamreport
.. Kontrolle      : mh
.. Funktion       : 
.. Functionality  : 
.. ATTENTION: This program must not call fo command .end. Each error handling
..            must take place outside this fop. Example see ev/VORGANG.SPERR
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
.type text  xsuch         ? _F|defined(U|xsuch)
.type VID99 xid           ? _F|defined(U|xid)
.type VP16  xpartner      ? _F|defined(U|xpartner)
..
.formula U|xsuch   = "A" + 'U|xid^such' ? F|regindex(U|xid^such, "[0-9]") = 1
.assign U|xpartner = 'U|xid^aukunde^id'
.assign U|xpartner = U|xid^aukunde^firma             ? _F|empty(U|xid^aukunde^firma)
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
